/word-mcp-server/
/word-mcp-server.venv/
mobile.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local working documents
#
# These record in-flight thinking and the history of a single pass. The
# committed record of what changed and why is the commit messages, plus
# `docs/CLEANUP-LOG.md`. A reviewer should not have to read a working file to
# understand the repository.
/REFINEMENT-PLAN.md
/REFINEMENT-*.md
/NOTES-*.md
/FINAL-SWEEP.md
/FINAL-SWEEP-*.md
